    {
      "name": "4. Upload (choose a file first)",
      "description": "In each request open Body > form-data and pick an image (JPEG/PNG/GIF/WEBP, max 5 MB) on the 'file' row. Skip this folder when running the whole collection in the Runner, because it needs a file chosen by hand.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Upload image to recipe",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
